Package: aurora-kbd-light
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: keyboard backlight that follows the ambient light (Aurora)
 aurora-kbd-light sets the keyboard backlight of Apple silicon MacBooks from
 the ambient light sensor, as macOS does. Its service is enabled on every Mac
 and skips machines without a keyboard backlight; a udev rule starts it when
 the backlight or the light sensor registers after boot.
